    "value": {
      "id": 67731,
      "0": "The one who carries this finds their movements fluid and their presence commanding. Every plate glides with a serpentine grace, offering a defense as impenetrable as a dragon's hide. A dim yellow radiance emanates from the gold, marking the owner as a figure of significant power."
